   "start_sec": 47.222,
   "end_sec": 47.931,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D012-S02",
   "unit_id": "C08-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "教室でこの本を読みます。",
   "start_sec": 48.081,
   "end_sec": 49.957,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D012-S03",
   "unit_id": "C08-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "村の写真の本です。",
   "start_sec": 50.107,
   "end_sec": 51.865,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D013-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "素敵な写真ですね。",
   "start_sec": 52.215,
   "end_sec": 54.083,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D013-S02",
   "unit_id": "C08-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "真ん中に小さい家がありますね。",
   "start_sec": 54.233,
   "end_sec": 57.237,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D014-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "こんな静かな村が好きです。",
   "start_sec": 57.587,
   "end_sec": 59.441,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D014-S02",
   "unit_id": "C08-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "リンさんの家の周りはどうですか。",
   "start_sec": 59.591,
   "end_sec": 61.933,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D015-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "高層ビルがあります。",
   "start_sec": 62.283,
   "end_sec": 64.003,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D015-S02",
   "unit_id": "C08-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "昼は騒がしいです。",
   "start_sec": 64.153,
   "end_sec": 65.75,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D015-S03",
   "unit_id": "C08-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "夜はそんなにうるさくないです。",
   "start_sec": 65.9,
   "end_sec": 68.035,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D016-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D016",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "わたしの家の周りは静かです。",
   "start_sec": 68.385,
   "end_sec": 70.183,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D016-S02",
   "unit_id": "C08-D016",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "いい環境ですよ。",
   "start_sec": 70.333,
   "end_sec": 71.505,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D017-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "今は六時四十分です。",
   "start_sec": 71.855,
   "end_sec": 74.452,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D017-S02",
   "unit_id": "C08-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "日本語クラスは七時からですよ。",
   "start_sec": 74.602,
   "end_sec": 76.942,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D018-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 77.292,
   "end_sec": 78.357,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D018-S02",
   "unit_id": "C08-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "六時五十分まで教室で本を読みます。",
   "start_sec": 78.507,
   "end_sec": 81.959,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D018-S03",
   "unit_id": "C08-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "この本はおもしろいです。",
   "start_sec": 82.109,
   "end_sec": 84.115,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D019-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "こんばんは。",
   "start_sec": 84.465,
   "end_sec": 85.273,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D019-S02",
   "unit_id": "C08-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "寒いですね。",
   "start_sec": 85.423,
   "end_sec": 86.484,
   "review_flags": [
    "no_silence_between_anchors",
    "clip_asr_difference"
   ],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D019-S03",
   "unit_id": "C08-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "リンさんの国は今、暑いですか。",
   "start_sec": 86.634,
   "end_sec": 88.723,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D020-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "はい、とても暑いです。",
   "start_sec": 89.073,
   "end_sec": 91.191,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D020-S02",
   "unit_id": "C08-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "パクさん、そのマフラーは真っ白ですね。",
   "start_sec": 91.341,
   "end_sec": 94.291,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D021-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "いいマフラーですね。",
   "start_sec": 94.641,
   "end_sec": 96.354,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D021-S02",
   "unit_id": "C08-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "わたしは寒い夜が嫌いです。",
   "start_sec": 96.504,
   "end_sec": 98.56,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D022-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "これは手触りがいいですよ。",
   "start_sec": 98.91,
   "end_sec": 100.577,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D022-S02",
   "unit_id": "C08-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "今日は会社で働きます。",
   "start_sec": 100.727,
   "end_sec": 102.477,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D022-S03",
   "unit_id": "C08-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "夜は忙しいです。",
   "start_sec": 102.627,
   "end_sec": 103.903,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D023-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D023",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "今日は日本語クラスに来ますか。",
   "start_sec": 104.253,
   "end_sec": 106.351,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D024-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D024",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "いいえ、今日は来ません。",
   "start_sec": 106.701,
   "end_sec": 108.259,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D024-S02",
   "unit_id": "C08-D024",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "今、駅に行きます。",
   "start_sec": 108.409,
   "end_sec": 109.603,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D025-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D025",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "駅の前の店においしいパンがありますよ。",
   "start_sec": 109.953,
   "end_sec": 113.179,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D026-S01",
   "unit_id": "C08-D026",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "ありがとうございます。",
   "start_sec": 113.529,
   "end_sec": 114.855,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D026-S02",
   "unit_id": "C08-D026",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "あの店のパンは安いですね。",
   "start_sec": 115.005,
   "end_sec": 117.066,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C08-D026-S03",
   "unit_id": "C08-D026",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "店でパンを買います。",
   "start_sec": 117.216,
   "end_sec": 118.594,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  }
 ]
}
